            <ArticleTitle>Impact of conditional cash transfers on child nutritional outcomes among sub-Saharan African countries: a systematic review protocol.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2295-2299</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.11124/JBISRIR-2016-003251</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="REVIEW QUESTION/OBJECTIVE:" NlmCategory="UNASSIGNED">The objective of this review is to assess the impact of conditional cash transfers on child nutritional outcomes among sub-Saharan African countries. More specifically, the objectives are to assess the impact of conditional cash transfers on child anthropometry, micro-nutrient, and improvement in dietary diversity of households.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
